Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:23:00.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The unknown calls to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:12.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Does your courage burn to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:15.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}We rush on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:18.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}For everyone to survive together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}For happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:27.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Though there is pain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:35.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}We will not be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:40.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Those who know the beautiful Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:45.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Restore its wonders
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bring it back, bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:52.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The road to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Determined to reach our destination
